@startuml topologia-hub-spoke
title Topología Hub-Spoke: Flujo de Configuración y Datos

participant "Peer A" as PA
participant "Orchestrator" as Orch
participant "Hub Agent" as Hub
participant "Peer B" as PB

note over PA, PB
  **Hub-Spoke** (default)
  Todos los peers se conectan solo al HUB.
  No hay comunicación directa peer-to-peer.
end note

PA -> Orch : config.get_peer_config
Orch --> PA : {peer: {pub: HUB, endpoint: HUB_IP, allowed_ips: CIDR}}
PA -> PA : wg0.conf: solo bloque [Peer] para HUB

PB -> Orch : config.get_peer_config
Orch --> PB : {peer: {pub: HUB, endpoint: HUB_IP, allowed_ips: CIDR}}
PB -> PB : wg0.conf: solo bloque [Peer] para HUB

PA -> Hub : tráfico via wg-HUB
Hub -> PB : reenvía via wg-HUB

note over PA, PB
  **Características**:
  - 2 saltos (peer → HUB → peer)
  - Funciona con cualquier NAT
  - HUB es bottleneck y single point of failure
  - Latencia alta
end note

@enduml
